Adapted parts:

  - ATVV service/characteristic UUIDs and capability command bytes
  - ATVV capability parsing
  - IMA/DVI ADPCM decoding and frame accumulation
  - PCM three-point smoothing and bounded gain
  - Xiaomi RC003 HID vendor/product matching (0x2717 / 0x32B8)
  - RC003 HID report usage parsing and keyboard-page usage map
  - Voice key usages (F5 / 0x3E and 0x0C)

